{"id":86079,"slug":"c-sa-z-ocean-parku-2024","title":"Císař z Ocean Parku","title_en":"Emperor of Ocean Park","year":2024,"rating":63,"votes_count":37,"runtime_min":508,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":"2024-11-07","plot":"Příběh Talcotta Garlanda, uznávaného profesora práv, jehož poklidný život je narušen, když mu otec, soudce Oliver Garland, zemře na infarkt.(Max)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an8gG0KBoCLeTaZBoSIhYNKHnP0.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5YJbzqsdW7siA3OM6YU93LlRWbb.jpg","trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Krimi","Drama","Mysteriózní"],"tags":["podle knihy"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Cheryl Dunye","Damian Marcano","Quyen Tran"],"actors":["Forest Whitaker","Bryan Greenberg","Henry Simmons","Grantham Coleman","Tiffany Mack","Keith Powers","Maya Ford","Jasmine Batchelor","Torrey Hanson","Avery Holliday","John Judd","Keith Kupferer","Julian Parker","Amy Sloan","Mike Geraghty","Amita Rao","James Vincent Meredith","Ora Jones","Deanna Reed-Foster","Paulina Lule","Jacki Hydock","Marsha Estell","Omar Benson Miller","Amir Henderson","Dyllan Yelverton","Dan Waller","Kroydell Galima"],"screenwriters":["Sherman Payne","Francesca Butler","Cynthia Adarkwa","Shukree Tilghman","J.D. Shields"],"cinematographers":["Carolina Costa","Shawn Peters","Brendan Uegama","Laura Merians Goncalves"],"composers":["Amanda Delores Patricia Jones"],"reviews":[{"author":"Lacike","text":"Zaujímavý námet o temnom tajomstve váženého sudcu, ktoré sa snaží odhaliť jeho rodina po jeho smrti. Bol by z toho strhujúci film. Ale v desaťdielnej minisérii to je strašne rozťahané a dej je zaplnený zbytočnými nezaujímavými líniami. Všetko podstatné sa odhalí v ôsmej časti, ktorá ukazuje jak strhujúce to mohlo byť. Z hercov jednoznačne znova kraľuje Forest Whitaker ako prísny, zásadový ale aj tragicky chybujúci sudca a otec rodiny, ktorú sa snaží chrániť. Finále je dostatočne uzatvorené ak by ďalšia séria nevznikla, ale sú tu aj drobné vrátka pre druhú sériu, ktorá ak vznikne, tak ju pravdepodobne vynechám. Bez Foresta by to pre mňa aj tak nemalo význam a ostatné postavy ma príliš nezaujali. 6/10.(26.12.2024)","stars":3},{"author":"plechulka","text":"Maličko rozvleklý seriál o tom, že nic není takové, jaké se na povrchu zdá, a tajnosti v rodině si vybírají svou daň.(28.12.2024)","stars":3}],"vods":[{"platform":"HBO Max","url":"https://www.hbomax.com/cz/en/shows/emperor-of-ocean-park/9894cc6a-178c-4608-a2ad-54b99aea4384"},{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.91edcaef-97c4-488b-8e60-bfa9714e4089"},{"platform":"MGM+","url":null}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/1540689-cisar-z-ocean-parku/prehled/","csfd_id":1540689,"root_id":1540689,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":1,"episode_count":10,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2024-07-14","last_vod_date":"2024-09-15","episodes":[{"season_no":null,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2024-07-14","title":"Chapter One (E01)","platforms":["HBO Max","MGM+"]},{"season_no":null,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2024-07-21","title":"Chapter Two (E02)","platforms":["HBO Max","MGM+"]},{"season_no":null,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2024-07-28","title":"Chapter Three (E03)","platforms":["HBO Max","MGM+"]},{"season_no":null,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2024-08-04","title":"Chapter Four (E04)","platforms":["HBO Max","MGM+"]},{"season_no":null,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2024-08-11","title":"Chapter Five (E05)","platforms":["HBO Max","MGM+"]},{"season_no":null,"episode_no":6,"vod_date":"2024-08-18","title":"Chapter Six (E06)","platforms":["HBO Max","MGM+"]},{"season_no":null,"episode_no":7,"vod_date":"2024-08-25","title":"Chapter Seven (E07)","platforms":["HBO Max","MGM+"]},{"season_no":null,"episode_no":8,"vod_date":"2024-09-01","title":"Chapter Eight (E08)","platforms":["HBO Max","MGM+"]},{"season_no":null,"episode_no":9,"vod_date":"2024-09-